# a driver that imports a module from lib/
** chapter: 12 Modules (modules.html)
** project: module_demo.eve (this driver) and lib/geometry.eve (the module); a module is the one kind
** of code that needs its own file, because other programs import it
driver module_demo is
  from lib use (geometry);            ** members are reached as geometry.member
  from lib use (geometry as g);       ** or through an alias

  process main is
    new p := geometry.Point(1, 2);
    p.shift(2, 3);                    ** an extension method exported by the module
    print "p = ({p.x}, {p.y})";
    print "squared distance to origin: {g.distance2(p, g.Point(0, 0))}";
    print "unit: {geometry.UNIT}";
  return;
end module_demo;
